{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25812","headline":"新楼诗二十首 新楼 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首 新楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戎容罢引旌旗卷，朱户褰开雉堞高。\n山耸翠微连郡阁，地临沧海接灵鳌。\n坐疑许宅驱鸡犬，笑类樊妻化羽毛。\n惆怅桂枝零落促，莫思方朔种仙桃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}